{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">炎炎夏日，海南陵水南灣猴島的獼猴，為了消暑各出奇招。有獼猴躲在樹蔭下乘涼，跳入水池暢泳，甚至問遊客要汽水、雪條降溫。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.HN.MONKEY.MTV.0626-0715_003.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026hKcirtO8Qm1784079191.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.HN.MONKEY.MTV.0626-0715_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-15T01:58:05.428454+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":58,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}